      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1978 the first phase of Sienna’s master‑planned community began with homes, roads, and a 10‑mile levee for flood protection.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
