      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The community officially dropped “Plantation” from its name in May 2019 after residents asked to distance itself from its enslaved‑labor past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sienna%2C_Texas",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Brazos River runs just west of Sienna’s western border, while Oyster Creek flows southward through the center of the CDP.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
